使いです。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"魔法使い一族の使命と復讐のゆえに、悪魔たちを追い、狩っています。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"悪魔たちには、人間の欲望につけこむ能力があるため、出来るだけ感情を排して、己を律するようにしています。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"それゆえ孤独を好んでいましたが、「神代ひかる」との出会いで、それが変化していきます"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6692","sourceWorkId":"22166","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"狩猎恶魔的魔法使,了一族的使命与复仇而不停狩猎着恶魔。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"因为恶魔拥有利用人类的欲望的能力，所以排除感情严于律己。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"因此喜欢孤独，但因为和神代ひかる的相遇而逐渐发生着变化。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"66839"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/54/54df1b13168a985bbf1b2c803f7adecc8b7015d61fbfa55ca226c11f09040a26.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/25/2503917eb3cc9418625074ea79a560f7b22e7b2bd5f1f9b4bce7a150ad43e5d9.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"瑞沢渓","creatorId":"vndb:s28","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s28","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s28","name":"瑞沢 渓","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:145388:66839:5741:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c35167","characterName":"神代 ひかる","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"66840","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"145388"}],"egsCharacterIds":["6693"],"vndbCharacterId":"c35167"},"originalCharacterName":"神代 ひかる","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"本作のもうひとりの主人公。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"明るく前向きな性格で、他人を思いやることが出来る女の子です。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"元気活発で、運動神経はかなり良く、そのせいで複数の運動部をかけもちさせられています。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"エレナとの出会いで、彼女の日常は大きく変わることになります。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6693","sourceWorkId":"22166","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格开朗积极，能为他人着想的女孩子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"活泼好动，运动神经良好，因此在好几个运动部之间来回跑。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"与艾莉娜的相遇极大地改变了她的日常。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"66840"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b9/b95e3052164e368fd49a035524e3505537d1d5175f777aeb39e735ebee3f1e31.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/43/43b5fb9f6420c6933d39ec210a34755f6993ad914c2440c4b72cf674bf6d99e5.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"野中カオリ","creatorId":"vndb:s106","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s106","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s106","name":"野中 カオリ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:145388:66840:6409:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c35168","characterName":"リディア・アーヴィング","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"66841","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"145388"}],"egsCharacterIds":["6694"],"vndbCharacterId":"c35168"},"originalCharacterName":"リディア・アーヴィング","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"エレナの母親で、同じく魔法使いの一族です。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"優しく母性溢れる女性で、娘のことを愛しており、出会ったひかるに、娘の友人となって支えてほしいと望んでいます。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6694","sourceWorkId":"22166","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"艾莉娜的母亲，同样是魔法使一族。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格温柔，充满母性的女性，疼爱女儿。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"希望与女儿相遇的ひかる能够成为女儿的友人并扶持她。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"66841"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6c/6c8